    {
      "ref": "TMM/Part47/1/1/3/2",
      "quote": "The application must be accompanied by a declaration which complies with reg 21.6, setting out the reasons in support of the grounds on which the application is made. If the initial period has expired, the declaration should also include the reason why the application was not made within the period (regs 5.9, 17A.34C)."
