    {
      "ref": "TMM/Part47/1/1/3/3",
      "quote": "In granting an extension of time, the Registrar must be satisfied as to the grounds set out in the application and the reasons given in support of those grounds. If the extension application was filed out of time, the Registrar must also be satisfied that there was sufficient reason for the application not being made within time (regs 5.10, 17A.34D)."
